"text": "Two controls mutate source and revert, so they are one-shot runs at implement and not entries: step 9's remove-the-guard run (`evidence/local-command-guard-control.md`) and step 7's run with the warning's calls neutralised (`evidence/rewritten-path-warning-control.md`). On every re-run the named entries for their cases and the guard on `src/cmd/verify/typed.rs` hold the same properties. The three files under `evidence/` are records implement writes (step 11), not artifacts an entry produces, so no entry carries `artifact`."
},
{
"from": 190,
"to": 193,
"text": "Five builders share this host (inputs#I1). A red whose shape is a stalled start, where every test that spawns a process stalls by one common amount while tests that spawn nothing pass in milliseconds and no assertion fails on a value, is re-read once no other build runs before it is treated as real; the red entry's log is read before the re-run overwrites it (`.claude/rules/verification-harness.md`, 2026-09-29 as extended 2026-10-06)."
}
